Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 00:51:50 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1033/1259] Corners follow the profile everywhere

A --r-pill token (20 px Rounded, 7 px Softer, 2 px Square) for every chip-like shape: the
Kit own chips and engine tag (20 px fixed before), the theme picker filters, and the HERESY
steps, artifact chips and tags, kind badges, writing-room chips. The HERESY bars, tabs and
step marks take --r-sm / --r-pill; the take meta card --r-lg. Level colours in the lyrics
check and the artifacts take the theme --good and --bad.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
